The ARC adapter (tckdb_arc/) began as ARC's own TCKDB upload module. The
following files hold code or data ported from ARC:

  tckdb_core/tckdb_core/xyz.py
      Element data and the xyz helpers (xyz_from_data, check_xyz_dict,
      xyz_to_str, get_most_common_isotope_for_element), from
      arc/species/converter.py and arc/common.py; ConverterError, from
      arc/exceptions.py.
  tckdb_core/tckdb_core/data/elements.yml
      Element symbols, numbers and masses, loaded by xyz.py.
  tckdb_core/tckdb_core/physical_constants.py
      Physical constants, from arc/constants.py.
  tckdb_arc/tckdb_arc/_vendor.py
      read_yaml_file, from arc/common.py.
  tckdb_arc/tckdb_arc/levels.py
      The level-of-theory normaliser used to compare an atom-correction
      level with an energy level, ported from ARC's
      _normalized_method_and_basis.

